--- stdout
Format PureScript source files.

Usage: iris format [--write] [--check] [PATH]…

Arguments:
  [PATH]…  Files to format. Omit this argument, or pass `-`, to read standard input.

Flags:
      --write  Rewrite files in place.
      --check  Report files that would change without rewriting them.
  -h, --help   Print help
